ones, Henry Stuart, editor. Oxford: Oxford University Press, 1910. (1942 printing).", "cts_urn": "urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0003.tlg001"}}, "work2": {"aid": "4029", "wid": "001", "title": "de Bellis", "meta": {"author_id": "4029", "author_latin": "Procopius", "author_greek": null, "title_latin": "de Bellis", "title_greek": null, "title_english": null, "edition": null, "cts_urn": "urn:cts:greekLit:tlg4029.tlg001"}}}